# Boards this example is built and gated for, one per line. The M.2 Key E socket
# (IW416: SDIO on USDHC1, Bluetooth HCI on LPUART2) is on the MIMXRT1170-EVKB and
# on Nosh, not on the 1060 boards. The nosh half boots the EVKB machine through
# gate-lib's nosh arm; the variant gates (run_qemu_{lifecycle,media,soak}.sh)
# build their own image per board through gate_cmake_board_args, so a nosh sweep
# gets Nosh images. Load-sensitive class on both boards (CLAUDE.md 2026-09-18
# note): a red half under a busy host is re-run idle before it counts.
rt1176
nosh
